    <guid isPermaLink="false">677bc6b31962f0b751b96634</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jan 2025 12:06:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期继续邀请嘉宾雨音真白和Dumi，聊聊巫女以及爱车相关话题。同时拥有GR86和SUPRA很常见的事。1月10~12日，在千叶幕张会展中心举行的东京改装展上。欢迎来北10号馆Tom's展位支持雨音真白，主播和Dumi也会在现场。本期播客在中日两地录制，因网络问题画面和声音有一些瑕疵，请大家多多包涵。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FovgFuFWA50b91aw35EYxm9jSQ7x.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk7zd0dZJKM_cXWeRCP2mrgvUluv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期参与者】</span></p><span></span><p><span>雨音真白（在日声优、巫女、自媒体创作者，Tom's Racequeen ，二次元爱好者@</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/26669485/dynamic" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/26669485/dynamic"><span>雨音真白</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>DumiBirdF（INSPEED RACING电竞车队队长，iRacing世界前0.5%，SGT爱好者 @</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/7967233?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/7967233?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>DumiBirdF</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：JM叔（零反打播客、@</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/14063695?spm_id_from=333.1365.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/14063695?spm_id_from=333.1365.0.0"><span>东方JDM字幕组</span></a><span>主理人，国内仅存的某汽车杂志资深编辑）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span>改装车篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 欢迎大家来TAS Tom's展台支持雨音真白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 与兰博基尼的情缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 巫女的工作之一是为汽车祈福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 谁会为汽车祈福？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 同时拥有GR86&amp;GR SUPRA其实很常见？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> GR86改装方面的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 日本RQ行业对形象需求，也逐渐发生了变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> Dumi对民用车的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span>东京改装展TAS，欢迎来嘉宾雨音真白的Tom's展位支持，主播和Dumi也会在现场。本期播客在中日两地录制，因网络问题画面和声音有一些瑕疵，请大家多多包涵。</span></p>]]></description>
